xt\\n   -> {\\\"artifacts\\\":[],\\\"count\\\":0}\\n\\nImpact: the discovery gate in work-backlog-item's validate.md Step 2.5 (and any other step that gates on artifact list/get after artifact register) cannot verify its own writes and will loop or falsely report DiscoveryFail.\\\" \\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Not specified\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-16\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **bug(backlog-mcp): artifact register reports content_stored:true but artifact list/get return zero results for same item-id** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"9d178470893e2c7302e7c7afc5a71a64dd49ea48df122bf89a580f7ba49cc2e2\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPToZHA\"}"}